{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "07977ce3-ba87-8f7a-8bd0-d0189af481db",
  "created_at": "2025-12-23T15:10:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Fernando Souza",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:04:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:05:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes, hi. Sorry to bother you. My name is Fernando Souza. I'm calling about my trash, my recycling really. I hope I have the right department."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:05:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You do, Mr. Souza, that's us. What happened with the recycling?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:05:19-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it's the second time in a row they missed me. I put the bin out the night before, like you're supposed to, and the last two weeks, nothing. It was still full at the curb in the afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:05:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so two pickups in a row missed. Let me get your address so I can look at the route. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:05:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 66 Malbone Road. In the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:05:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "66 Malbone Road. Did I get that right, sixty-six?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:05:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, sixty-six. That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:05:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. And you said the bin was out the night before. Was it at the curb, in front of the house, not in the driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:06:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "At the curb, yes. Right by the mailbox. I'm sorry, is that the correct way? I always do it that way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:06:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, that's exactly right. You're not doing anything wrong. Now, you also said the bin. Is something wrong with the bin itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:06:20-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, yes, I forgot to say. The one time they did come, last month, the truck damaged it. The lid is cracked right off the hinge, and there's a split down the side. It was fine before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:06:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the truck broke it during a pickup. Cracked lid and a split in the side. Is it the recycling bin or the trash barrel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:06:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The recycling bin. The blue one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:06:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The blue recycling bin, okay. I can put in a request for a replacement. Can you still use it at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:06:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sort of. I put a brick on the lid, but it gets wet inside when it rains."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:07:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note that too. Now let me check the route for Malbone. Hold on a moment, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:07:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, take your time. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:07:12-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for waiting. So I see your street on the Tuesday route, and the crews are working the holiday schedule this week. Were you told to put it out on a different day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:07:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. Nobody told me. It's always Tuesday. Is today not the day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:07:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Today is Tuesday, so you should be on. Did the truck already come by today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:07:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not that I saw. I got home about one and the bin was still there, full."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:07:44-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sometimes the trucks run later before the holiday. I'll send a missed pickup report for today and for the last two weeks. The crew may come back through, so leave the bin out tonight. One more thing, the supervisor said the truck is coming down Malbone from the south end today, so if you hear it, that's why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:08:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "From the north end, you said? Sorry, I want to make sure I heard right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:08:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "South. The south end. South, with an S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:08:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "South, okay. Thank you. I thought you said north. I'm sorry, I'm a little hard of hearing on this phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:08:24-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No need to apologize. Let me say it again so it's clear. The truck is coming up from the south end of Malbone Road, so it would reach you after the lower houses."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:08:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, from the south. Got it. I'll leave it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:08:41-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Now, for the replacement bin, I have the blue recycling bin, cracked lid and split side, damaged by the truck, at 66 Malbone Road. Is there a phone number in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:08:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0175."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:08:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0175. Let me read that back. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-five. Correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:09:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's correct. Did I do this right? Is there a form I should fill out also?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:09:08-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No form needed. I'm entering it now, the missed pickups and the damaged bin. Once the replacement is ready, they typically drop it at the curb, so keep an eye out. You may not see anyone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:09:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, all right. And should I keep the broken one out, or put it away?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:09:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Leave the broken one at the curb with the lid on it as best you can. They'll swap it, or take it when they bring the new one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:09:39-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Leave the broken one at the curb. And the brick, should I take that off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:09:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take the brick off, yes, just so nobody gets hurt picking it up. Tie the lid down if you have some twine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:09:55-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do have twine. All right. So just to check, the bin stays out tonight, the truck comes from the south, and the new bin gets left at the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:10:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly. And if it's still sitting there full tomorrow, call us back and we'll escalate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:10:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you very much, Miss Medeiros. Sorry again for bothering you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:10:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's no bother at all. Happy holidays, Mr. Souza."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T15:10:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, you too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
